From 069481cf6167499f779b30ccebc6ac981b611940 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Darshan Hegde <darshanhegde1156@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:00:36 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 03/13] FeatureGate: react to battery changes, add dumpsys, cmd
 and listener API

- Registers for sticky ACTION_BATTERY_CHANGED at PHASE_SYSTEM_SERVICES_READY
  on a dedicated ServiceThread; re-evaluates rules only when percent or
  plug state changes.
- Notifies listeners of features whose allowed state flipped, outside the
  lock, serialized on the service thread.
- Adds dump() for 'dumpsys feature_gate' and a ShellCommand for
  'cmd feature_gate set-rule/remove-rule/check'.
- FeatureGateManager: Listener + Executor registration via a hidden
  ListenerTransport stub.

Change-Id: I0b9b5b68134d2ca6737071a71afb96ab9d00c2c0
